stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle : no recipe
    Idle --> Waiting : recipe set, inputs missing
    Waiting --> Operating : inputs present + power
    Operating --> Waiting : inputs exhausted / output full
    Operating --> NoPower : OperatingRate = 0
    Waiting --> NoPower : OperatingRate = 0
    NoPower --> Waiting : power restored
    Operating --> Operating : CycleProgress += rate*dt;\non >=1 ConsumeInputs + ProduceOutputs
    Operating --> Idle : recipe cleared
    Waiting --> Idle : recipe cleared

    note right of Waiting
        Waiting draws 25% power (idle rate).
        Operating draws 100%. Idle/NoPower draw 0.
    end note
